# Vaccine Delivery

September, 2026
Organizational Planning   
For this project, I utilized a pen, paper and produced a digital simulation via Claude. 

---

## 1. Urgent Planning for Vaccines
Your team of 3–4 operators must plan and execute an emergency vaccine distribution operation from the Eau Claire depot to all 12 Chippewa Valley clinics during a severe blizzard. You must develop a delivery schedule that meets every clinic’s pallet requirements and delivery windows while obeying vehicle capacities, travel restrictions, refrigeration limits, DOT driving regulations, and the single loading dock constraint. The team with the lowest total operational cost among all valid delivery schedules wins the contract.

